 stack

Evaluate technology options: decision record comparing a hosted BaaS
(Supabase) with our own Express + SQLite API, single-file CDN React with
React + Vite, and Google Maps / Mapbox / Leaflet / MapLibre for the map.

- Prototype: single-file React from a CDN + Supabase, for speed
- Final: Express + node:sqlite + React/Vite, all TypeScript
- Map: MapLibre GL + OpenStreetMap tiles, Nominatim geocoding cached in
  geocache. No paid API key, account or billing

Builds on Tareq's draft (docs/TECH-DECISIONS.md, tareq/sprint-6-design-docs).

